_workspace/
__pycache__/
evolution/plugin/node_modules/
graphify-out/
skills/.bundled_manifest
skills/.curator_state
skills/.usage.json
skills/.usage.json.lock
skills/browser-use/
# App-managed skills: written into ~/.claude (this repo) on every launch of the
# app that owns them, so tracking them here means permanent churn and a stale
# copy waiting to be clobbered. Their source of truth is version-controlled in
# the owning repo — mom-* live at steve-desktop/skills/mom-*/SKILL.md. Edit
# them THERE; a change made here is gone on the next launch.
skills/mom-question/
skills/mom-transfer/
# skills/synced/ is a plugin-cache mirror (docx/pptx/xlsx/mcp-builder/skill-creator
# and friends, several MB) that a sync tool drops in by content hash. It is derived
# data with a per-run directory name, so tracking it means permanent churn and a
# repo that grows on every sync. Found untracked at 3.8 MB on 2026-09-16.
skills/synced/

# Cross-CLI message center: the log ships with the repo (same box path on every
# machine, no username in it); cursors are device-local
.msgbox/*
!.msgbox/log.jsonl

.worktrees/

# /skill-doctor writes these beside the file it rewrites; they are backups,
# not source, and `git add -A` during a machine-switch park swept one into
# history on 2026-08-30.
*.doctor-bak
